WEBVTT

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:32.209
[Full-Time Magister 2]

00:00:32.375 --> 00:00:35.542
♪ The rising dawn
cuts through the night ♪

00:00:35.751 --> 00:00:38.460
♪ And destroys the darkness ♪

00:00:38.562 --> 00:00:42.549
♪ A new wing shall emerge ♪

00:00:43.003 --> 00:00:46.185
♪ And soar through the sky ♪

00:00:47.015 --> 00:00:50.357
♪ Smoke appears in
conflicted dimensions ♪

00:00:50.669 --> 00:00:53.307
♪ Waiting for someone's arrival ♪

00:00:53.689 --> 00:00:58.234
♪ Protecting the
unshakable belief within us ♪

00:00:58.474 --> 00:01:00.372
♪ And never backs down ♪

00:01:01.007 --> 00:01:04.871
♪ The sacred fountain lays there ♪

00:01:05.312 --> 00:01:08.633
♪ Shocked by what appeared
in front of us ♪

00:01:09.019 --> 00:01:12.065
♪ The star atlas has open
a path for our journey ♪

00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:15.505
♪ Laughing while we watch
the world from above ♪

00:01:15.938 --> 00:01:19.040
♪ He had given me everything ♪

00:01:19.134 --> 00:01:23.218
♪ The truth in sight is unpleasant ♪

00:01:23.258 --> 00:01:25.980
♪ Anger that is insurmountable ♪

00:01:25.981 --> 00:01:30.389
♪ That unique soul
was born to be a hero ♪

00:01:30.532 --> 00:01:33.659
♪ The torrential rain can't be
stopped by the hot-blooded ♪

00:01:33.699 --> 00:01:37.584
♪ The chosen one will not
bid farewell easily ♪

00:01:37.606 --> 00:01:40.449
♪ I will create a miracle ♪

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:45.986
♪ With the burning fire
in my wounded heart ♪

00:01:46.193 --> 00:01:50.284
♪ I promise ♪

00:02:44.286 --> 00:02:44.846
Money,

00:02:45.297 --> 00:02:46.591
go and distract the one at the fountain.

00:02:47.292 --> 00:02:50.584
The rest of us will kill the one
at the rock garden quickly.

00:02:51.208 --> 00:02:53.862
Then, if we kill them one by one,

00:02:54.058 --> 00:02:55.538
it won't be so dangerous.

00:03:00.425 --> 00:03:02.953
Since Brother Fan can do it,
I can do it too.

00:03:04.202 --> 00:03:05.429
I can't hold our team back.

00:03:07.454 --> 00:03:09.214
I'll walk over there, infuriate it,

00:03:09.785 --> 00:03:10.625
then run away quickly.

00:03:11.635 --> 00:03:13.475
I'll have to remember to
not run in a straight line...

00:03:13.699 --> 00:03:16.139
to give more time to
Brother Fan and the others.

00:03:39.343 --> 00:03:40.730
Why did it jump over directly?

00:03:46.154 --> 00:03:47.114
Wind...

00:03:47.397 --> 00:03:48.197
Wind magic!

00:04:23.608 --> 00:04:24.368
Oh no.

00:04:24.806 --> 00:04:27.206
This creature used trees
to bounce around.

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:33.849
Oh no, it's faster than me.

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:36.927
The method that Brother Fan
taught me is useless now.

00:04:50.068 --> 00:04:51.041
Wind magic!

00:05:08.304 --> 00:05:09.941
What should I do?

00:05:10.578 --> 00:05:13.451
If I can't get rid of him,
I'll be eaten by it.

00:05:15.106 --> 00:05:16.733
I don't want to die here.

00:05:18.761 --> 00:05:21.387
If only someone could help me...

00:05:23.906 --> 00:05:26.195
What am I thinking about?

00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:28.216
Who can save me now?

00:05:29.995 --> 00:05:33.678
Furthermore, if I die, this bloodthirsty
One-eyed Wolf Demon...

00:05:34.032 --> 00:05:35.432
will go to Brother Fan and the others.

00:05:35.858 --> 00:05:38.999
Then, everyone will die because of me.

00:05:55.653 --> 00:05:58.009
I'll try using that tactic.

00:06:13.086 --> 00:06:14.920
Wind magic, Fleeting shadow!

00:06:22.606 --> 00:06:25.679
This is the third level of Wind magic,
Wind magic, Fleeting shadow!

00:06:26.543 --> 00:06:27.569
This is awesome.

00:06:27.609 --> 00:06:30.888
The bloodthirsty One-eyed Wolf Demon
looks more slow now.

00:07:36.252 --> 00:07:37.239
It's true that...

00:07:37.710 --> 00:07:40.884
the One-eyed Wolf Demon
isn't as scary as I thought it would be.

00:07:59.581 --> 00:08:04.126
This won't do. My Ice talent won't be
able to freeze this One-eyed Wolf Demon.

00:08:05.011 --> 00:08:06.990
Quick, inform them.

00:08:07.202 --> 00:08:08.442
I can't hold on for long.

00:08:09.692 --> 00:08:11.915
Mu Bai, we should escape.

00:08:12.325 --> 00:08:14.475
This creature is too scary.
We might die in its hand.

00:08:14.924 --> 00:08:16.897
Do you think we can safely...

00:08:17.049 --> 00:08:19.183
enter the protective barrier
without the help of others?

00:08:24.599 --> 00:08:26.557
-Let's go!
-Okay!

00:08:44.265 --> 00:08:46.187
Go on, it won't hold on for long!

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:48.289
I know. My Thunder
isn't weaker than yours.

00:08:55.853 --> 00:08:56.600
Brother Fan...

00:08:57.082 --> 00:08:58.269
is still fighting it?

00:08:59.138 --> 00:09:00.927
Xiaohou?

00:09:01.611 --> 00:09:03.391
Xiaohou, are you okay?

00:09:03.421 --> 00:09:04.491
You're badly hurt!

00:09:04.492 --> 00:09:06.810
-You're badly hurt!
-Mr. Xue, his wound...

00:09:06.826 --> 00:09:08.066
Looks like the bleeding won't stop.

00:09:09.966 --> 00:09:10.899
Mr. Xue!

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:19.470
Oh no, it's catching up.

00:09:19.629 --> 00:09:20.283
I'll do it.

00:09:20.284 --> 00:09:22.113
The rest of you can go against
this half dead creature.

00:09:22.483 --> 00:09:23.163
Got it.

00:09:24.965 --> 00:09:26.176
Mu Bai, Zhao Kunsan,

00:09:26.190 --> 00:09:26.903
down!

00:09:31.691 --> 00:09:32.465
Are you okay?

00:09:33.918 --> 00:09:35.627
Do you know this is dangerous?

00:09:46.167 --> 00:09:47.917
Thunder Magic, Thunderstorm!

00:09:53.584 --> 00:09:54.502
Fire Burst!

00:09:59.313 --> 00:10:00.193
Cremation!

00:10:20.256 --> 00:10:21.150
It's over.

00:10:23.417 --> 00:10:26.335
Mo Fan could finish
casting all the magic.

00:10:27.318 --> 00:10:29.705
When did he become so powerful?

00:10:55.759 --> 00:10:57.260
The tyre bursts...

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:00.608
in a place like this.

00:11:01.762 --> 00:11:02.575
What?

00:11:03.075 --> 00:11:04.155
Then, hurry up and fix it.

00:11:04.278 --> 00:11:06.905
But, if monsters appear here...

00:11:06.981 --> 00:11:08.379
That's  why I said hurry up!

00:11:35.074 --> 00:11:37.056
Friend, come and help me.

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:38.610
I can't do it on my own.

00:11:40.506 --> 00:11:41.252
Friend?

00:11:43.497 --> 00:11:44.473
Where did he go?

00:11:52.713 --> 00:11:53.939
Since everyone is okay, that's great.

00:11:54.792 --> 00:11:58.167
I didn't expect us to win against
three matured One-eyed Wolf Demon.

00:11:58.897 --> 00:12:01.671
Many teachers wouldn't believe us
if we told them about it.

00:12:05.185 --> 00:12:06.425
It's all thanks to Mo Fan's orders.

00:12:07.510 --> 00:12:08.456
Yes.

00:12:08.973 --> 00:12:09.746
Brother Fan,

00:12:09.918 --> 00:12:13.293
you could probably kill one
One-eyed Wolf Demon with your ability.

00:12:13.759 --> 00:12:14.786
Yes, I could.

00:12:15.082 --> 00:12:16.895
But, it would be hard.

00:12:17.549 --> 00:12:19.522
Honestly if that One-eyed Wolf Demon...

00:12:19.623 --> 00:12:21.383
wasn't froze by Mu Bai,

00:12:21.876 --> 00:12:24.710
I wouldn't be able to safely
and continuously cast magic.

00:12:25.765 --> 00:12:26.552
Of course.

00:12:31.402 --> 00:12:32.386
For mages,

00:12:32.431 --> 00:12:33.951
teamwork is more important.

00:12:34.733 --> 00:12:37.475
Earth talent mages can slow down
and remove the enemy.

00:12:39.502 --> 00:12:42.569
Wind talent mages
can stop strong monsters.

00:12:43.542 --> 00:12:47.251
Water talent mages can save their
teammates' lives during crucial moments.

00:12:48.715 --> 00:12:52.131
Everyone, please remember what I said.

00:12:52.409 --> 00:12:54.062
Let alone to reach
the protective barrier safely,

00:12:54.438 --> 00:12:55.465
but at least...

00:12:55.516 --> 00:12:57.542
prevent any unnecessary deaths.

00:13:00.872 --> 00:13:03.005
There are two types of monsters
that we are facing right now,

00:13:03.332 --> 00:13:05.386
the Cyclops and
the One-eyed Wolf Demons.

00:13:06.035 --> 00:13:08.662
The Cyclops are actually
quite easy to deal with.

00:13:10.375 --> 00:13:11.975
But, the One-eyed Wolf Demons
are horrible.

00:13:12.334 --> 00:13:16.126
They are much more savage and cunning
than the Cyclops.

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:20.337
You don't have to say that.
I know about it already.

00:13:22.321 --> 00:13:25.395
Mu Bai, you're the most
powerful mage here.

00:13:25.582 --> 00:13:27.649
You'll have to control
your Creeping Ice all the time.

00:13:27.691 --> 00:13:30.211
Remember, the Creeping Ice
is now to protect everyone.

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:32.633
Don't think of using it to freeze
monsters that move at an unusual speed.

00:13:33.058 --> 00:13:34.911
Mu Bai should attack.

00:13:35.063 --> 00:13:36.863
Why should he serve as a handy man?

00:13:36.903 --> 00:13:38.477
Mu Fan, at this time of crisis,

00:13:38.517 --> 00:13:39.752
you're still thinking of
suppressing Mu Bai?

00:13:40.311 --> 00:13:41.698
If you keep on talking nonsense,

00:13:41.786 --> 00:13:43.079
even if the monsters don't come
to attack you,

00:13:43.093 --> 00:13:44.430
I'll destroy you first.

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:49.064
I know what I should do.

00:13:54.751 --> 00:13:57.335
He Yu, work with Mr. Xue
to protect everyone.

00:13:59.088 --> 00:13:59.731
Me?

00:14:01.212 --> 00:14:03.542
He Yu, don't feel guilty.

00:14:03.584 --> 00:14:06.251
I've met many Water talent students
who weren't as capable as you.

00:14:06.500 --> 00:14:09.527
Everyone will feel nervous
when they are attacked by monsters.

00:14:09.805 --> 00:14:12.858
Mo Fan stayed in
the Hunters' team for a long time...

00:14:12.898 --> 00:14:14.883
before he developed his willpower.

00:14:15.071 --> 00:14:18.069
If I released my Aqua magic,

00:14:18.321 --> 00:14:20.094
will Zhang Yinglu still be alive?

00:14:21.156 --> 00:14:22.904
You can't blamed yourself for her death.

00:14:23.184 --> 00:14:24.584
Everyone is capable,

00:14:25.275 --> 00:14:27.755
but I'm useless.

00:14:28.468 --> 00:14:29.362
I...

00:14:30.593 --> 00:14:31.993
Adjust your mentality.

00:14:32.277 --> 00:14:34.810
Have more confidence...

00:14:35.072 --> 00:14:36.989
in yourself.

00:14:38.743 --> 00:14:40.569
Xiaohou!

00:14:40.582 --> 00:14:41.208
Xiaohou!

00:14:42.070 --> 00:14:43.590
-What's wrong?
-Xiaohou, you...

00:14:44.904 --> 00:14:46.317
His wound wouldn't stop bleeding.

00:14:46.674 --> 00:14:47.420
Xiaohou!

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:50.160
If the bleeding won't stop, he'll die.

00:14:50.336 --> 00:14:52.416
If the bleeding won't stop,
his life will be in danger.

00:14:52.507 --> 00:14:54.453
You were attacked by
the One-eyed Wolf Demon's Crush Claw.

00:14:54.537 --> 00:14:56.780
It will cause your wound
to keep bleeding.

00:14:56.916 --> 00:14:59.476
Bandaging it or using fire
to stop the bleeding won't work.

00:15:00.832 --> 00:15:03.612
We have to find a special medication,
the hemostatic agent.

00:15:04.633 --> 00:15:05.993
We don't have much time.

00:15:06.042 --> 00:15:08.834
How can we find a safe route
for everyone?

00:15:10.195 --> 00:15:11.862
But, we can't let Zhang Xiaohou bleed.

00:15:14.287 --> 00:15:15.869
Yes, I remembered it.

00:15:16.286 --> 00:15:18.512
There's a pharmacy on the food street
in front of the garden.

00:15:19.007 --> 00:15:20.927
It won't take much time
for us to go there.

00:15:21.914 --> 00:15:24.982
After we get the hemostatic agent,
we can go on to the protective barrier.

00:15:26.116 --> 00:15:27.823
Okay, I'll go there.

00:15:29.005 --> 00:15:30.759
Don't delay, continue on the journey.

00:15:30.876 --> 00:15:32.010
I'll catch up soon.

00:15:33.825 --> 00:15:34.705
No need.

00:15:34.904 --> 00:15:37.304
I think you don't have to...

00:15:37.313 --> 00:15:39.100
waste precious time for me.

00:15:39.641 --> 00:15:42.033
We have a few thousand people behind us.

00:15:42.990 --> 00:15:44.550
Monkey.

00:15:47.779 --> 00:15:49.805
Without you keeping guard in front
as the Wind talent mage,

00:15:50.125 --> 00:15:52.459
we, the vanguards can't go far...

00:15:52.493 --> 00:15:53.708
before we all perish.

00:15:58.512 --> 00:16:00.764
I'll be back soon.
Wait for me.

00:16:35.802 --> 00:16:38.177
♪ Pressing onward courageously ♪

00:16:38.880 --> 00:16:42.290
♪ With the burning dreams in our heart ♪

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:45.611
♪ We are reminiscing
the dreams of our past ♪

00:16:46.252 --> 00:16:47.732
♪ And it gives me strength ♪

00:16:48.125 --> 00:16:50.001
♪ The most stubborn wings ♪

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:53.686
♪ Dreamt that we will not
wander anymore ♪

00:16:54.018 --> 00:16:57.943
♪ And hoped that we will
fly further one day ♪

00:16:59.416 --> 00:17:03.341
♪ With the dim lights
shining through the sky ♪

00:17:04.334 --> 00:17:09.281
♪ Shine through our heart
and fill in the ups and downs ♪

00:17:10.342 --> 00:17:13.603
♪ I'm as proud as the sun ♪

00:17:13.915 --> 00:17:16.769
♪ The clouds are moving
in the distance ♪

00:17:17.036 --> 00:17:19.361
♪ Since I have decided to be unique ♪

00:17:19.504 --> 00:17:22.412
♪ I will break all barriers
and shine through ♪

00:17:22.737 --> 00:17:25.459
♪ Life is ever-changing ♪

00:17:25.594 --> 00:17:29.011
♪ But I will soar through the sky ♪

00:17:29.337 --> 00:17:31.306
♪ The hope that is beating within me ♪

00:17:31.878 --> 00:17:34.975
♪ Writes a new chapter for me ♪

00:17:35.520 --> 00:17:39.359
♪ We will battle once more
if we have the chance ♪

00:17:39.947 --> 00:17:46.184
♪ To be the everlasting light
in the world ♪
